OrderType.description:
MT5's `ENUM_ORDER_TYPE`: `buy` and `sell` are market orders (`ORDER_TYPE_BUY`, `ORDER_TYPE_SELL`);
`buy_limit`, `sell_limit`, `buy_stop`, `sell_stop`, `buy_stop_limit` and `sell_stop_limit` are
pending orders (`ORDER_TYPE_BUY_LIMIT` and so on); `close_by` is `ORDER_TYPE_CLOSE_BY`.
